<title>USA: Nashville Country Club names Cusworth CFO.</title>
<headline>Nashville Country Club names Cusworth CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nashville Country Club Inc said on Wednesday that Bryan Cusworth has been named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Nashville Country Club said Cusworth was formerly with a public accounting firm where he specialized in the hospitality, real estate and entertainment industries.</p>
<p>The company did not immediately say who Cusworth was succeeding.  </p>
<p>Company spokesman Jerry Daly said later that Cusworth is replacing former CFO Gregory Rowkoskie. Daly said Rowkoskie left about three months ago.</p>
</text>
